Do you want to raise a fluffy cat? Then come to this open pet cat world! Hatch surprise eggs! Feed and dress up your pet cats. Play, explore, make friends and have fun with them!

GIVE BIRTH TO BABY CATS
Just put two fluffy cats into a magical merge machine, press the start button, and out pops an egg. After hatching each egg, you'll receive 25 different kittens! In DIY mode, you can even create your own unique kittens!

TAKE CARE OF YOUR PET CATS
Do you know how to take care of newborn baby cats? Feeding, bathing, potty-training them and much more. What if they get sick? Don't worry! Take them to the pet therapy room for a full checkup! What if they get hungry? Go to the kitchen and make magic desserts for them!

CREAT CAT STORIES
Let's go outside and explore! Explore the primeval forest, City in the Sky, Four Seasons Town and more! You'll meet lots of new cat friends along the way! Decorate the living room, write letters inviting friends over, and you can keep creating new cat stories!

DRESS UP BABY CATS
The pet dressing room is finally upgraded! There are various pretty clothes! Which to wear, traditional suits, delicate princess dresses, or Chinese costumes? Try them all on your cat! Look, the cat is so happy in its new clothes!

PLAY WITH PET CATS
Play with the baby cat all day long! Challenge the ball maze, row the boat, push the box and more! There are many different games that you can play. By playing these games, you can also receive many keys. These keys can be used to open mysterious treasure chests that contain great rewards!

Download Little Panda's Cat Game, take care of your fluffy baby animals, and grow up with them!

FEATURES:
- An open pet cat world without any game objectives or rules;
- Care for pet cats with varying appearances and moods;
- Create new cats continuously;
- Hatch surprise eggs through magic merge machine;
- Unlock multiple interactions: feeding, playing, dressing up, exploring, and making friends;
- Decorate the living room and invite your cat friends;
- Nearly 20 types of ingredients to develop magic cat recipes;
- Explore the outdoors: go to the forest, City in the Sky and Cat Town;
- Nearly 70 kinds of clothes and accessories for you to dress up cats;
- New events update every season and holiday.

